 5. + This 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Content creators are becoming investable asset classes, per Scalable , a newsletter that exclusively covered what it calls "a Nasdaq for creators." 

 GigaStar, a platform that lets users invest in creators, has launched an SEC-registered secondary trading platform that lets investors buy and sell securities tied to a creator's future YouTube ad revenue. Mady thought bubble: Apropos of nothing, just a friendly reminder here that the generic financial advice to invest into low-cost funds appropriate for your risk tolerance historically works out, and even outperforms expensive actively managed funds. 

 
 
